Join me next time,
when I'll show you

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.240
how easy it is to use Cloud
Shell Editor to deploy

00:04:11.240 --> 00:04:12.920
to Google Kubernetes Engine.

00:04:12.920 --> 00:04:14.150
See you then.

